<ul>
<li>Tower Hill</li>
<li>Edison</li>
<li>Florida Peninsula</li>
<li>American Integrity</li>
</ul>
<p>With that said, <strong>your home insurance premium is determined by many factors</strong>, so without <a href="/get-a-quote/get-a-home-insurance-quote/">getting a quote from a licensed insurance agent</a> we can’t give you an exact answer in this article, but we can give you a ballpark figure of what to expect.</p>
