<p>One of the things that you may notice from these tables is that <strong>as the size and age of your house increases, you should</strong> <strong>expect your home insurance premium to increase.</strong> As your house ages and your home insurance premium increases, it’s always a good idea to have an independent insurance agent get competing quotes for you about once every year or two—and especially after a major weather event like a hurricane—because some insurance carriers favor certain types of houses over others.</p>
